[N 33-35 Booty Bay and the Drowned City]
[D Forever Shaman 30-60 (Braedyn)\\Booty Bay (inn, Expert Fishing, Baron Revilgaz's optional Stone of the Tides chain on the haunted isle) and the Drowned City, the sunken troll city off the Stranglethorn coast: Krazek's Saltseer pirates and Timear's idol in one run, then the hand-ins in Booty Bay, the Dalaran crater (only for the idol) and Ironforge.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel 34|r  -  this chapter wants level 34: Krazek's two Saltseer quests and Timear's idol need it, and the Drowned City quests are level 40 (mob levels inside are not in the data; the Brinescale naga on the coast outside are 36-38). You arrive at about 33. At 33, do the optional Stone of the Tides block first (two quests of 2,850 XP plus ~17 elemental kills) and take Krazek's quests when you come back; every quest of the run needs 34, so do not go in under it: still under 34 after the block (or skipping it), kill the Lesser Water Elementals on the haunted isle (36-37) until you ding.
[OC]|cffffcc00Carried in:|r Talk of the Town (98463, Barkeep Kelly, chapter 27) hands in here. A Fine Mess (2904) only if you kept it from Gnomeregan. Hearth = Southshore until the inn below; the Booty Bay flight point is known (chapter 30).
[OC]|cffffcc00Faldir's Cove:|r the cove quests (663-669, level 35) are done in chapter 39 on the Arathi visit, with 670 and 667.
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Training:|r no shaman trainer here; the chapter ends in Ironforge at Eldrun (the level 34 row, and the 36 row if you are 36).

[OC]|cffffffffBooty Bay|r  -  the inn, Talk of the Town, the Expert Fishing book and Krazek all stand within a few units of the inn (27.0,77.3)
At [TAR6807 Innkeeper Skindle], bind your Hearthstone to [S Booty Bay] (the Southshore bind from chapter 27 ends here; chapter 32 binds Theramore) [G27.0,77.3 Stranglethorn Vale]
