At [TAR2626 Old Man Heming], [V] buy Expert Fishing - The Bass and You (1g) (needs Fishing 125 and level 20) and read it at once: Fishing cap 225 [G27.4,77.2 Stranglethorn Vale]
[O]At [TAR2664 Kelsey Yance], [V] Recipe: Rockscale Cod (22s) (Cooking 175, +12 Fishing food: skill filler for the coast fish) and, if gold allows, Recipe: Cooked Glossy Mightfish (1g 60s) (Cooking 225, +30 attack power, eaten from level 35: the next step up after Mithril Head Trout - learn it at 225) [G28.2,74.3 Stranglethorn Vale]
[O]At [TAR7853 Scooty], [QT2904] (2,450 XP - only if you kept A Fine Mess from chapter 24) [G27.6,77.5 Stranglethorn Vale]
