[O]At [TAR773 Krazek], [QA95789 Shady Saltseers] (3,900 XP, needs level 34: 10 Voodoo-Infused Artifacts from the Saltseer pirates inside, |cffffcc00grind|r) [G26.9,77.2 Stranglethorn Vale]
