[OC]|cffffffffIronforge|r  -  Eldrun in the Forlorn Cavern
[A Shaman] In the Forlorn Cavern at [TAR258098 Eldrun Stormbreaker], [T] train every rank your level allows that the sheet marks must or buy (level 32 row if not bought yet: musts Lightning Shield 4, buys Windfury Totem 1, Healing Wave 6 - 80s each; Fire Nova 3 - 73s 68c; level 34 row, nothing must, when gold is easy: Frost Shock 2 - 90s; level 36 row, only at 36: musts Earth Shock 5, buys Mana Spring Totem 2, Lesser Healing Wave 3 - 1g each) [G47.1,13.8 Ironforge]
[OC]|cffffcc00Gold check:|r quest money so far is about 27g 69s if you did every optional quest from chapter 02 on (this chapter: up to 2g 30s, all of it from optional quests). This chapter's shopping was the Expert Fishing book (1g) and, optional, the two recipes (1g 82s). Riding at 40 is the next big cost: keep vendoring greys and spare cloth.
[OC]|cffffcc00Check:|r handed in here: Talk of the Town (98463) and The Saltseer Captain (95791); Shady Saltseers (95789), Ancient Gurubashi Secrets (97130), A Fine Mess (2904) and the Stone of the Tides chain (616 to 611) are handed in or abandoned (one run, one Duncan kill, the 17-kill budget). Still carried on purpose: Storm, Earth, and Fire (79358, totems from chapter 32), The Missing Diplomat (1248, chapter 32), Reclaimers' Business in Desolace (1453, chapter 33), Mythology of the Titans (1050) and Past Due (96800, both chapter 34), Ironband Wants You! (707, chapter 35) and Stepping Stones (79192). Next: Dustwallow Marsh, from Gryth Thurden at the Ironforge flight master (55.5,47.7)
